er of Pens sold</span></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Anand</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">480</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">360</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">240</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1080</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Bharat</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">280</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">420</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">560</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1260</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Chetan</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">640</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">320</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">480</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1440</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Deepak</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">450</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">300</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">600</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">1350</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Total number of Pens sold by Sohan = 120/100&nbsp;&times; 1080 = <strong>1296</strong></p>\n\n<p>Required Difference = 1296 - 1260 = <strong>36</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Hence, correct answer is option</strong> <strong>3</strong>.</p>",
